      "heading": "[ edit 4 1 Quick Notes ]",
      "text": "4_1 is also known as \"the Figure Eight knot\", as some people think it looks like a figure `8' in one of its common projections. See e.g. [1] . For two 4_1 knots along a closed loop, see 10_59 , 10_60 , K12a975 , and K12a991 . [ edit 4 1 Further Notes and Views ] Square depiction Alternate square depiction 3D depiction In \"figure 8\" form A Neli-Kolam with 3x2 dot array [1] In curved symmetrical form",
